OL,3,GNEWSAA52 racing will lead to tragedy,
OL,4,Awarn residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near a stretch of the
OL,7,FA52 in Nottinghamshire say vehicles
OL,8,Fracing along the road is "an accident
OL,9,Fwaiting to happen".
OL,11,FThey describe the A52 Brian Clough Way
OL,12,Ffrom Bramcote Island as a regular spot
OL,13,Ffor drivers of modified vehicles to
OL,14,Frace along the dual carriageway towards
OL,15,FBardills roundabout, which connects to
OL,16,Fthe B6003 Toton Lane.
OL,18,FSusanna Atassi, who lives nearby, is
OL,19,Fconcerned a crash on the 1.5-mile
OL,20,F(2.4km) section of the road is
OL,21,F"inevitable" if deterrents are not put
OL,22,Fin place.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
